    {
      "id": 1,
      "start": 0.95,
      "end": 13.731,
      "label": "mandarin",
      "text": "这一段时间，在荔浦市茶城乡过城村古堰村的种植基地，工人们正忙到给接种了豆天蛾幼虫种苗的防豆苗覆盖防护网。",
      "score": 0.2946,
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.0765,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.271,
        "seg_cer": 0.245,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.167,
        "phon_examples": "虫/从 市/斯",
        "text_free": "这一段时间，在利普斯查城乡郭城村古堰藤的种植基地，工人们正忙着给接种了。昨天我又从种苗的防痘苗覆盖防护网。",
        "dur": 12.781,
        "n_char": 49
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "start": 13.917,
      "end": 21.703,
      "label": "mandarin",
      "text": "从空中俯看，一张张白色的薄纱网在阳光下宛如是一片薄雾。",
      "score": 0.0183,
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.0032,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.0,
        "seg_cer": 0.04,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "text_free": "从空中俯瞰，一张张白色的薄纱网在阳光下，宛如是一片薄雾。",
        "dur": 7.786,
        "n_char": 25
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "start": 22.271,
      "end": 26.06,
      "label": "uncertain",
      "text": "根据了解，豆丹是豆天蛾的幼虫，",
      "score": 0.388,
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.1446,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.543,
        "seg_cer": 0.231,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "text_free": "根据了解，豆蛋是豆田窝的幼虫。",
        "dur": 3.789,
        "n_char": 13,
        "text_check": "留意"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "start": 26.06,
      "end": 30.12,
      "label": "mandarin",
      "text": "这种生长在大豆植株上以豆叶为食的软体昆虫，",
      "score": 0.0229,
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.0034,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.0,
        "seg_cer": 0.05,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "text_free": "这种生长在大豆植株上，以豆叶为食的原体昆虫。",
        "dur": 4.06,
        "n_char": 20
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "start": 30.366,
      "end": 33.417,
      "label": "uncertain",
      "text": "被古人赞誉为豆中人参。",
      "score": 0.4978,
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.1368,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.512,
        "seg_cer": 0.2,
        "lang_free": "Cantonese",
